<title>USA: Ratings upgrades brighten sunglass firm stocks.</title>
<headline>Ratings upgrades brighten sunglass firm stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in sunglass companies rose strongly on Wednesday, boosted by a ratings upgrade for retailer Sunglass Hut International Inc.</p>
<p>The company's shares rose 1-1/2 to 7-3/8 in very heavy trade after Montgomery Securities analyst Alice Ruth raised the retailer's rating to buy from a hold. Details of the rating increase were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
